==Description==
The '''Woodland Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from Private I rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Woodland Nametag''' has text with a dark green to dim black gradient and a black outline. Green, khaki and brown camo background can be seen behind the text. An icon of the Private rank can be seen next to the text.

